| `flatpak`      | Linux with the `flatpak` CLI on `PATH` (system scope)          | [Flatpak](/bootstrap/packages/flatpak.html)         |
| `flatpak-user` | Linux with the `flatpak` CLI on `PATH` (user scope)            | [Flatpak](/bootstrap/packages/flatpak.html)         |
